WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
The agent is running on the host. No attack so far.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:10.500
From another host the site answers. Then a SYN flood starts.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:16.500
The agent detects the SYN flood and raises a critical alert.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:21.000
Its response puts the flooding address on the block list.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.500
The flooding host now gets no answer. The app host is still served.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.000
The block is written to the audit log with the rule that took it.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The alert queue of the console, in its standalone demo mode with sample data.
